# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Growth Catalyst — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your real values.
# NEVER commit real credentials to the repository.
#
# These same variables must also be set in the Vercel dashboard:
#   Project Settings → Environment Variables
#   → Add for: Production, Preview, Development
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Gmail address used to send contact form emails
GMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com

# Gmail App Password (NOT your regular Gmail password!)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Prerequisites:
#   1. Enable 2-Step Verification: https://myaccount.google.com/security
#   2. Generate an App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#
# Google displays App Passwords with spaces (e.g., "abcd efgh ijkl mnop").
# You can paste it with or without spaces — the API strips whitespace automatically.
#
# If using Google Workspace, your admin may need to allow App Passwords at the org level.
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=abcd efgh ijkl mnop

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Apps Script Web App URL
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This is the URL of the deployed Google Apps Script that
# receives intern form submissions and logs them to a Google Sheet.
#
# To set this up:
#   1. Open your Google Sheet
#   2. Go to Extensions → Apps Script
#   3. Paste the contents of scripts/google-apps-script-code.gs
#   4. Deploy → New Deployment → Web App
#   5. Set "Execute as" to "Me" and "Who has access" to "Anyone"
#   6. Copy the generated URL and paste it below
#
# The URL looks like:
#   https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycb.../exec
VITE_GOOGLE_SCRIPT_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_DEPLOYMENT_ID/exec
